*
* Diode Sim Model Produced by Altium Ltd
* Date:  24-Mar-2003
*
* Manufacturer: Philips
* Component Name: PMBD7000
*
*Note: This macromodel derived from data sheets and pspice models obtained from Philips Semiconductor.
*
* 1 = Anode; 2 = Cathode; 3 = Common Connection
.SUBCKT PMBD7000 1 2 3
X1 1 3 DPMBD7000
X2 3 2 DPMBD7000

* This macromodel models the effect of carrier recombination-generation
* and high-level injection on the diode.
.SUBCKT DPMBD7000 10 30
D1 10 20 DIDEAL
D2 10 20 DRECOMB
D3 20 30 DHIGH

* Subcircuit models
.MODEL DIDEAL D
+(
+  IS =  6.0289E-09
+  N =  2.1283
+  TT =  5.7708E-09
+  CJO =  5.9363E-13
+  VJ =  0.68774
+  M =  0.1
+  BV =  113.6
+  IBV =  1.00E+01
+)

.MODEL DHIGH D
+(
+  IS =  0.04
+  N =  2.1283
+  RS =  0.001
+)

.MODEL DRECOMB D
+(
+  IS =  0.000000001
+  N =  2.5
+)

.ENDS DPMBD7000
.ENDS PMBD7000